  "summary": "dlab_workshop exfiltrates environment variables and host identifiers to oastify.com on require",
  "details": "On module load, index.js collects process.env, process.cwd(), os.userInfo(), and process.argv and POSTs the JSON to a hardcoded Burp Collaborator subdomain at https://9eojg3y52itd6161v4lhojajrax1lw9l.oastify.com. Any require/import of the package causes the installer's full environment (including any credentials present in env vars) plus host identity to be sent to an attacker-controlled out-of-band interaction endpoint. The destination is unrelated to any legitimate workshop functionality.",
